<div class="pane">
	<header class="pane-header">
		<h3>{{ phrase('agent.tickets.status_closed') }}</h3>
	</header>
	<article class="pane-content no-pad">
		<form class="form-horizontal dp-form" role="form" name="form_props" ng-submit="TicketStatusEdit.saveLabel()">
			<div class="panel panel-fill indent">
				<div class="panel-body">
					<div class="form-group">
						<div class="col-lg-3">
							<h3>About</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="col-lg-9">
							For very large helpdesks with millions of tickets, archiving can greatly improve performance of the agent interface and filters.
							When an old ticket is archived it is moved out of your filters and into the 'Archived' section. You can still view archived tickets and agents with permission can restore archived tickets
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="form-group">
						<div class="col-lg-3">
							<h3>Enabled</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="col-lg-9">
							<button dp-toggle-switch ng-model="TicketStatusEdit.enabled"></button>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="form-group">
						<div class="col-lg-3">
							<h3>Auto-Archive</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="col-lg-9">
							Automatically move resolved ticket to the archive after
							<select
								ui-select2
								ng-model="TicketStatusEdit.auto_archive_time"
								style="min-width: 240px"
							>
								<option value="86400" >1 day</option>
								<option value="259200" >3 days</option>
								<option value="432000" >5 days</option>
								<option value="604800" >1 week</option>
								<option value="1209600" >2 weeks</option>
								<option value="1814400" >3 weeks</option>
								<option value="2419000">1 month</option>
								<option value="4838000" >2 months</option>
								<option value="7257000" >3 months</option>
								<option value="14514000" >6 months</option>
								<option value="21771000" >9 months</option>
								<option value="29028000" >1 year</option>
								<option value="58056000" >2 years</option>
							</select>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="inner-footer">
				<div class="text-danger ng-hide" ng-show="form_props.$attempted && form_props.$invalid">
					<p><strong>{{phrase('adm.general.please_correct_errors')}}</strong></p>
					<ul>
						<li ng-show="form_props.label.$error.required">{{phrase('adm.general.label_edit_error')}}</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center" ng-hide="form_props.$attempted && form_props.$invalid">
					<div dp-hide-spinning="saving_label">
						<button class="btn btn-primary" dp-submit-form>{{phrase('agent.general.save')}}</button>
					</div>
					<div dp-show-spinning="saving_label">
						<i class="spinner-flat"></i>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</form>
	</article>
</div>